.\" Begin generated content:
.TH "cage" "1" "2026-07-05"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
cage \- a Wayland kiosk compositor
.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
\fBcage\fR [options.\&.\&.\&] [--] [\fIapplication\fR.\&.\&.\&]
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
Cage runs a single, maximized application.\& Cage can run multiple applications,
but only a single one is visible at any point in time.\& User interaction and
activities outside the scope of the running application are prevented.\&
.PP
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB-d\fR
.RS 4
Don'\&t draw client side decorations when possible.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-D\fR
.RS 4
Enable debug logging.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-h\fR
.RS 4
Show the help message.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-m\fR <mode>
.RS 4
Set the multi-monitor behavior.\& Supported modes are:
\fBlast\fR Cage uses only the last connected monitor.\&
\fBextend\fR Cage extends the display across all connected monitors.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-s\fR
.RS 4
Allow VT switching
.PP
.RE
\fB-v\fR
.RS 4
Show the version number and exit.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"
.PP
\fIDISPLAY\fR
.RS 4
If compiled with Xwayland support, this will be set to the name of the
X display used for Xwayland.\& Otherwise, probe the X11 backend.\&
.PP
.RE
\fIWAYLAND_DISPLAY\fR
.RS 4
Specifies the name of the Wayland display that Cage is running on.\&
.PP
.RE
\fIXCURSOR_PATH\fR
.RS 4
Directory where cursors are located.\&
.PP
.RE
\fIXCURSOR_SIZE\fR
.RS 4
Specifies the configured cursor size.\&
.PP
.RE
\fIXCURSOR_THEME\fR
.RS 4
Specifies the configured cursor theme.\&
.PP
.RE
\fIXKB_DEFAULT_RULES\fR, \fIXKB_DEFAULT_MODEL\fR, \fIXKB_DEFAULT_LAYOUT\fR,
\fIXKB_DEFAULT_VARIANT\fR, \fIXKB_DEFAULT_OPTIONS\fR
.RS 4
Configures the xkb keyboard settings.\& See \fBxkeyboard-config\fR(7).\&
.PP
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fBxkeyboard-config(7)\fR
.PP
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.PP
Report bugs at https://github.\&com/cage-kiosk/cage
.PP
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
